Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:06:33.50,HEADB,,0,0,0,,{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\fs38\c&H8CDC4A&\an8\pos(540,92)}鲁德 {\r\fnTL Score\b300\fs44}6-{\r\fnTL Score\c&H8CDC4A&\b1\fs44}7{\r\fnTL Score\fs44}⁴ {\r\fnTL Score\c&H8CDC4A&\b1\fs44}6-{\r\fnTL Score\b300\fs44}4 {\r\fnTL Score\c&H8CDC4A&\b1\fs44}10-{\r\fnTL Score\b300\fs44}8{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\fs38} 塞伦多洛 · 赛后新闻发布会
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.38,0:00:05.20,EN,,0,0,0,,Hi Casper, Tim, congratulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.38,0:00:05.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,嗨 卡斯珀 蒂姆 恭喜
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.20,0:00:07.78,EN,,0,0,0,,First one on the board for Team Europe.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.20,0:00:07.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,欧洲队先拿下一分
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.78,0:00:08.68,EN,,0,0,0,,Casper, should we start with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.78,0:00:08.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,卡斯珀 先从你开始？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.68,0:00:10.74,EN,,0,0,0,,Do you want to tell us how that feels?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.68,0:00:10.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,能说说现在的感受吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.74,0:00:13.30,EN,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it was a great start for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.74,0:00:13.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,是的 这是很好的开局
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.30,0:00:13.84,EN,,0,0,0,,Obviously,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.30,0:00:13.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,当然
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.84,0:00:15.74,EN,,0,0,0,,every point on the board is important
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.84,0:00:15.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,记分牌上每一分都重要
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.74,0:00:18.82,EN,,0,0,0,,and I knew that even though I was down.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.74,0:00:18.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,我也知道 就算我落后
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.82,0:00:20.94,EN,,0,0,0,,One set to love, I felt, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.82,0:00:20.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,输掉了第一盘 我也想
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.94,0:00:24.00,EN,,0,0,0,,let's try to pull this one out for the team
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.94,0:00:24.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,要为球队把这场拼下来
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.00,0:00:25.90,EN,,0,0,0,,and get a point on the board.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.00,0:00:25.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,先在记分牌上拿一分
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.90,0:00:26.84,EN,,0,0,0,,It's never over until it's
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.90,0:00:26.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,不到最后一刻
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.84,0:00:30.72,EN,,0,0,0,,over and obviously being a match tiebreak
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.84,0:00:30.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,就不算结束 而且决胜是抢十
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.72,0:00:34.44,EN,,0,0,0,,in the third makes you even more maybe
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.72,0:00:34.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,打在第三盘 可能让你更加
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.44,0:00:37.40,EN,,0,0,0,,willing to really fight to win at least one set
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.44,0:00:37.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,愿意拼到至少赢下一盘
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.40,0:00:39.52,EN,,0,0,0,,to get into a match tiebreak.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.40,0:00:39.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,好打进抢十
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.52,0:00:46.76,EN,,0,0,0,,So I was not pleased at all times
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.52,0:00:46.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以我并不是一直满意
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.76,0:00:47.98,EN,,0,0,0,,with my game but very pleased
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.76,0:00:47.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,自己打得怎么样 但非常满意
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.98,0:00:49.48,EN,,0,0,0,,with the win.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.98,0:00:49.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,能赢下来
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.48,0:00:53.18,EN,,0,0,0,,Let's have some questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.48,0:00:53.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,我们开始提问吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.54,0:00:56.64,EN,,0,0,0,,Congrats on the win.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.54,0:00:56.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,恭喜获胜
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.64,0:00:58.68,EN,,0,0,0,,Can you just talk about the tone early on?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.64,0:00:58.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,能谈谈开局的状态吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.68,0:01:00.68,EN,,0,0,0,,It looked maybe like a little nervy like you
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.68,0:01:00.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,看上去可能有点紧张 好像你们
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.68,0:01:02.18,EN,,0,0,0,,were both trying to find your way in.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.68,0:01:02.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,都在努力找感觉
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.18,0:01:04.00,EN,,0,0,0,,There were some uncharacteristic errors
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.18,0:01:04.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,有一些不像你们的失误
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.00,0:01:06.18,EN,,0,0,0,,but you eventually kind of got your feet
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.00,0:01:06.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,但你最后还是
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.18,0:01:07.52,EN,,0,0,0,,under you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.18,0:01:07.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,站稳了脚跟
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.52,0:01:08.44,EN,,0,0,0,,Yes, it was.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.52,0:01:08.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,是的 确实
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.44,0:01:10.70,EN,,0,0,0,,I wasn't finding particularly my returns,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.44,0:01:10.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,我的接发找不到感觉
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.70,0:01:14.10,EN,,0,0,0,,second serve returns that well.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.70,0:01:14.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,尤其是接二发
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.10,0:01:16.14,EN,,0,0,0,,I had a plan to try to go around
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.10,0:01:16.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,我原本计划侧身
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.14,0:01:17.08,EN,,0,0,0,,and play as many forehands
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.14,0:01:17.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,尽量多用正手
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.08,0:01:18.38,EN,,0,0,0,,as possible and I wasn't able
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.08,0:01:18.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,但我没能
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.38,0:01:21.48,EN,,0,0,0,,to get around the ball exactly how I wanted
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.38,0:01:21.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,按想要的方式绕到球后面
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.48,0:01:23.88,EN,,0,0,0,,and I miss hit a few and I hit a few long
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.48,0:01:23.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,有几拍打飞了 几拍出了底线
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.88,0:01:26.24,EN,,0,0,0,,and a little bit of maybe uncharacteristic
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.88,0:01:26.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,可能有点不像我
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.24,0:01:27.28,EN,,0,0,0,,as you said.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.24,0:01:27.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,就像你说的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.28,0:01:28.20,EN,,0,0,0,,When I play my best,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.28,0:01:28.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,我状态最好的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.20,0:01:29.76,EN,,0,0,0,,I don't do those mistakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.20,0:01:29.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,不会犯那些错
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.76,0:01:33.36,EN,,0,0,0,,So somewhat nervy, a little bit rusty.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.76,0:01:33.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以有点紧张 也有点生疏
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.36,0:01:35.40,EN,,0,0,0,,Maybe I haven't really played a match
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.36,0:01:35.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,可能我已经好几周
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.40,0:01:37.46,EN,,0,0,0,,at this level in a few weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.40,0:01:37.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,没打过这种级别的比赛了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.46,0:01:40.14,EN,,0,0,0,,Montreal was the last match I played
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.46,0:01:40.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,蒙特利尔是我上一次
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.14,0:01:43.26,EN,,0,0,0,,at a full high level and you feel it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.14,0:01:43.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,打出高水平的比赛 你能感觉到
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.26,0:01:47.08,EN,,0,0,0,,I mean, every player feels this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.26,0:01:47.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,每个球员都有这种感觉
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.08,0:01:49.28,EN,,0,0,0,,The feeling of playing good tennis is fresh.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.08,0:01:49.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,好网球的感觉要保持新鲜
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.28,0:01:50.38,EN,,0,0,0,,It can come and go fast
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.28,0:01:50.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,它来得快 去得也快
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.38,0:01:53.52,EN,,0,0,0,,and hopefully a win like today can show me
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.38,0:01:53.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,希望今天这样的胜利能告诉我
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.52,0:01:57.34,EN,,0,0,0,,that even without my perfect tennis,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.52,0:01:57.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,就算打不出完美的网球
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.34,0:01:59.50,EN,,0,0,0,,I can fight matches and win
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.34,0:01:59.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,我也能拼下比赛 赢下来
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.50,0:02:02.50,EN,,0,0,0,,against good players.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.50,0:02:02.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,哪怕对手是好球员
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.50,0:02:03.96,EN,,0,0,0,,Hi, Casper.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.50,0:02:03.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,嗨 卡斯珀
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.96,0:02:05.80,EN,,0,0,0,,Obviously, the team were really trying
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.96,0:02:05.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,显然 队友们一直很努力
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.80,0:02:07.48,EN,,0,0,0,,to pump you up and get you going.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.80,0:02:07.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,给你打气 帮你进入状态
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.48,0:02:08.82,EN,,0,0,0,,How much did that help?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.48,0:02:08.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,这帮了多大的忙？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.82,0:02:10.96,EN,,0,0,0,,It helped a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.82,0:02:10.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,帮了很大的忙
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.96,0:02:13.32,EN,,0,0,0,,Some of them, particularly Tim,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.96,0:02:13.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,有几个人 尤其是蒂姆
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.32,0:02:14.56,EN,,0,0,0,,to my side, he stayed all match
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.32,0:02:14.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,他全场都陪在我身边
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.56,0:02:19.12,EN,,0,0,0,,and it was a tough first set to lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.56,0:02:19.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,第一盘丢得很难受
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.12,0:02:20.30,EN,,0,0,0,,I just told myself,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.12,0:02:20.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,我就跟自己说
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.30,0:02:25.26,EN,,0,0,0,,let's try to win for the match.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.30,0:02:25.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,争取把这场赢下来
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.26,0:02:25.88,EN,,0,0,0,,Give it a good effort
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.26,0:02:25.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,全力去打
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.88,0:02:28.62,EN,,0,0,0,,and the guys pushed me and helped me
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.88,0:02:28.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,队友们推着我 帮着我
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.62,0:02:29.44,EN,,0,0,0,,and pulled for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.62,0:02:29.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,给我加油
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.44,0:02:31.26,EN,,0,0,0,,When we entered the match tiebreak,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.44,0:02:31.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,打进抢十的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.26,0:02:34.72,EN,,0,0,0,,it was nice to see all the guys on the bench.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.26,0:02:34.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,看到替补席上所有队友真好
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.72,0:02:35.88,EN,,0,0,0,,Didn't necessarily get off
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.72,0:02:35.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,抢十开局
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.88,0:02:37.40,EN,,0,0,0,,to a great start in the match tiebreak
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.88,0:02:37.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,并不算顺利
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.40,0:02:38.92,EN,,0,0,0,,but fought my way back
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.40,0:02:38.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,但我一路追了回来
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.92,0:02:41.02,EN,,0,0,0,,and won some important points towards
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.92,0:02:41.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,最后阶段赢下几分关键球
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.02,0:02:42.50,EN,,0,0,0,,the end which was fun
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.02,0:02:42.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,这很好玩
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.50,0:02:46.10,EN,,0,0,0,,to see the teammates get cheerful
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.50,0:02:46.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,能看到队友们欢呼
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.10,0:02:49.62,EN,,0,0,0,,and happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.10,0:02:49.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,开心
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.76,0:02:51.24,EN,,0,0,0,,Question for Tim,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.76,0:02:51.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,问蒂姆一个问题
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.24,0:02:53.00,EN,,0,0,0,,watching from the sidelines.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.24,0:02:53.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,你在场边看
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.00,0:02:54.22,EN,,0,0,0,,Was there any signs of encouragement
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.00,0:02:54.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,有没有什么迹象
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.22,0:02:56.16,EN,,0,0,0,,that you thought that Casper can come
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.22,0:02:56.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,让你觉得卡斯珀能
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.16,0:02:58.30,EN,,0,0,0,,through this match?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.16,0:02:58.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,挺过这场比赛？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.30,0:03:01.10,EN,,0,0,0,,It was very tough
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.30,0:03:01.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,这场非常难
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.10,0:03:03.20,EN,,0,0,0,,because there were so few opportunities.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.10,0:03:03.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,因为机会太少了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.20,0:03:05.86,EN,,0,0,0,,I think Casper, talking about struggling
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.20,0:03:05.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,我觉得卡斯珀说到
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.86,0:03:07.46,EN,,0,0,0,,a little bit on second serve return,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.86,0:03:07.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,接二发有点吃力
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.46,0:03:09.16,EN,,0,0,0,,I also think Cerundolo's quality
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.46,0:03:09.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,我也觉得塞伦多洛的发球质量
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.16,0:03:11.02,EN,,0,0,0,,of serving made life difficult from the back
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.16,0:03:11.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,让他在底线
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.02,0:03:11.66,EN,,0,0,0,,of the court.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.02,0:03:11.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,日子很不好过
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.66,0:03:13.62,EN,,0,0,0,,They're hitting so hard, so aggressively
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.66,0:03:13.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,他们打得又重又凶
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.62,0:03:15.84,EN,,0,0,0,,and that's a reflection why there
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.62,0:03:15.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,这就是为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.84,0:03:18.44,EN,,0,0,0,,were no break points in the first set.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.84,0:03:18.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,第一盘一个破发点都没有
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.44,0:03:19.82,EN,,0,0,0,,There were a couple of break points
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.44,0:03:19.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,第二盘出现了几个破发点
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.82,0:03:21.80,EN,,0,0,0,,in the second set and Casper was able
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.82,0:03:21.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,卡斯珀能够
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.80,0:03:23.46,EN,,0,0,0,,to get that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.80,0:03:23.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,把握住
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.46,0:03:26.56,EN,,0,0,0,,It felt like he was pushing water uphill
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.46,0:03:26.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,感觉他像是在逆水行舟
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.56,0:03:29.02,EN,,0,0,0,,because Cerundolo was impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.56,0:03:29.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,因为塞伦多洛打得太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.02,0:03:29.54,EN,,0,0,0,,Once he got
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.02,0:03:29.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,可一旦他
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.54,0:03:33.02,EN,,0,0,0,,into the Champions 10-point tiebreak,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.54,0:03:33.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,打进这个抢十
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.02,0:03:35.40,EN,,0,0,0,,anything can happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.02,0:03:35.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,什么都可能发生
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.40,0:03:37.20,EN,,0,0,0,,I think it emphasises not always
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.40,0:03:37.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,我觉得这说明 不一定
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.20,0:03:39.44,EN,,0,0,0,,about how you start, it's how you finish.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.20,0:03:39.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,不在开局 在于收尾
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.44,0:03:40.86,EN,,0,0,0,,I think the way Casper finished off
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.44,0:03:40.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,我觉得卡斯珀在抢十里
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.86,0:03:45.64,EN,,0,0,0,,in the tiebreak was very impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.86,0:03:45.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,收尾的方式非常出色
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.86,0:03:46.94,EN,,0,0,0,,Congratulations. Casper,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.86,0:03:46.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,恭喜 卡斯珀
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.94,0:03:49.08,EN,,0,0,0,,you are now quite used to the Laver Cup.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.94,0:03:49.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,你现在对拉沃尔杯已经很熟了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.08,0:03:50.42,EN,,0,0,0,,You had two different captains
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.08,0:03:50.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,你经历过两任不同的队长
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.42,0:03:53.24,EN,,0,0,0,,and vice captains, so is there a difference
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.42,0:03:53.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,和副队长 有没有什么不同
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.24,0:03:55.14,EN,,0,0,0,,between the coaching you
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.24,0:03:55.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,以前你得到的指导
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.14,0:03:57.32,EN,,0,0,0,,had before and now the coaching you
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.14,0:03:57.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,和现在相比
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.32,0:03:59.80,EN,,0,0,0,,have with this team?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.32,0:03:59.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,在这支队伍得到的指导？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.80,0:04:03.12,EN,,0,0,0,,Yes, there are a few differences.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.80,0:04:03.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,是的 有一些不同
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.12,0:04:04.78,EN,,0,0,0,,With Yannick and Tim,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.12,0:04:04.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,跟着诺阿和蒂姆
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.78,0:04:06.36,EN,,0,0,0,,there's quite a bit more singing
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.78,0:04:06.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,唱歌要多得多
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.36,0:04:11.62,EN,,0,0,0,,than with Bjorn and Thomas.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.36,0:04:11.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,比跟着博格和恩奎斯特的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.62,0:04:14.40,EN,,0,0,0,,I would say both Bjorn and Yannick,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.62,0:04:14.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,我会说博格和诺阿
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.40,0:04:15.58,EN,,0,0,0,,they are free souls,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.40,0:04:15.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,都是自由的灵魂
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.58,0:04:19.10,EN,,0,0,0,,free spirits and take life fairly easy
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.58,0:04:19.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,活得洒脱 生活挺随性
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.10,0:04:22.18,EN,,0,0,0,,and don't stress about too many things,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.10,0:04:22.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,不会为太多事情紧张
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.18,0:04:24.72,EN,,0,0,0,,which is nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.18,0:04:24.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,这很好
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.72,0:04:26.74,EN,,0,0,0,,Sometimes players maybe put too much
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.72,0:04:26.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,有时候球员可能给自己
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.74,0:04:28.58,EN,,0,0,0,,pressure and stress on themselves
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.74,0:04:28.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,太多压力和紧张
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.58,0:04:31.22,EN,,0,0,0,,and we do live a stressful life at times,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.58,0:04:31.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,我们有时确实活得很有压力
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.22,0:04:35.46,EN,,0,0,0,,but it's nice to have a mix of Yannick
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.22,0:04:35.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,但有诺阿这样的人很好
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.46,0:04:40.50,EN,,0,0,0,,who sees tennis in a different way,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.46,0:04:40.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,他看网球的方式不一样
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.50,0:04:44.94,EN,,0,0,0,,particularly to me and also contrast to Tim
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.50,0:04:44.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,尤其跟我比 也跟蒂姆形成对比
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.94,0:04:46.06,EN,,0,0,0,,who watches a lot of tennis
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.94,0:04:46.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,蒂姆看很多网球
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.06,0:04:47.94,EN,,0,0,0,,and commentates a lot of tennis.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.06,0:04:47.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,也解说很多网球
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.94,0:04:49.86,EN,,0,0,0,,He sees us almost not every week,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.94,0:04:49.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,他见我们不是每周
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.86,0:04:51.90,EN,,0,0,0,,but kind of month in, month out
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.86,0:04:51.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,但差不多每个月
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.90,0:04:52.74,EN,,0,0,0,,at the big tournaments
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.90,0:04:52.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,在大赛上
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.74,0:04:54.42,EN,,0,0,0,,and he knows strength and weaknesses
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.74,0:04:54.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,他了解我们每个人
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.42,0:04:57.54,EN,,0,0,0,,in all of our games.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.42,0:04:57.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,打法里的强项和弱点
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.54,0:05:01.68,EN,,0,0,0,,Both of them challenge me in a good way
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.54,0:05:01.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,他们俩都给了我很好的挑战
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.68,0:05:04.08,EN,,0,0,0,,because they come a lot more to the net
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.68,0:05:04.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,因为他们更常上网
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.08,0:05:05.90,EN,,0,0,0,,or they're used to it than I am doing
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.08,0:05:05.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,或者比我更习惯上网
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.90,0:05:07.66,EN,,0,0,0,,and they play a bit of a flatter ball
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.90,0:05:07.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,他们击球更平一些
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.66,0:05:10.60,EN,,0,0,0,,and challenge me to do that as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.66,0:05:10.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,也逼着我那样去打
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.60,0:05:13.58,EN,,0,0,0,,It's nice to hear other opinions
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.60,0:05:13.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,听到不同的意见很好
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.58,0:05:16.40,EN,,0,0,0,,that I haven't heard in many years from Tim
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.58,0:05:16.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,多年来我没听过的 来自蒂姆
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.40,0:05:19.66,EN,,0,0,0,,and Yannick.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.40,0:05:19.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,和诺阿
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.94,0:05:22.60,EN,,0,0,0,,A question for Tim.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.94,0:05:22.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,问蒂姆一个问题
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.60,0:05:24.38,EN,,0,0,0,,In terms of watching tennis,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.60,0:05:24.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,说到看球
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.38,0:05:25.42,EN,,0,0,0,,when you're watching your players
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.38,0:05:25.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,你看自己队员的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.42,0:05:28.34,EN,,0,0,0,,as a vice captain, do you watch it differently
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.42,0:05:28.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,作为副队长 看法会不一样吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.34,0:05:31.02,EN,,0,0,0,,than if you're watching a game as a pundit
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.34,0:05:31.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,跟你作为评论员
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.02,0:05:32.26,EN,,0,0,0,,or as a commentator?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.02,0:05:32.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,或者解说员相比？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.26,0:05:33.68,EN,,0,0,0,,No, not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.26,0:05:33.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,不 完全不会
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.68,0:05:36.16,EN,,0,0,0,,I've got a lot more vested interest watching
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.68,0:05:36.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,我现在看这些比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.16,0:05:36.88,EN,,0,0,0,,these matches
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.16,0:05:36.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,感情投入多得多
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.88,0:05:40.38,EN,,0,0,0,,because I'm part of the team,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.88,0:05:40.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,因为我是团队的一员
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.38,0:05:42.40,EN,,0,0,0,,but I'm always looking strategically
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.38,0:05:42.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,但我一直在从战术上看
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.40,0:05:45.40,EN,,0,0,0,,when I'm commentating who's doing what
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.40,0:05:45.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,解说的时候 看谁在做什么
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.40,0:05:47.94,EN,,0,0,0,,and why is one person winning,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.40,0:05:47.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,为什么这个人能赢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.94,0:05:50.58,EN,,0,0,0,,what are the strengths and weaknesses.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.94,0:05:50.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,优势和短板是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.58,0:05:53.72,EN,,0,0,0,,As Casper referenced, having been working
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.58,0:05:53.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,就像卡斯珀说的 我过去五年
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.72,0:05:56.80,EN,,0,0,0,,in the media for the last five years,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.72,0:05:56.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,一直在媒体工作
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.80,0:05:59.68,EN,,0,0,0,,I'm seeing a lot of these players play.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.80,0:05:59.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,看了很多这些球员的比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.68,0:06:04.54,EN,,0,0,0,,There aren't too many secrets or things
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.68,0:06:04.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,没有太多秘密
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.54,0:06:07.54,EN,,0,0,0,,that I haven't been able to watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.54,0:06:07.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,是我没看过的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.54,0:06:10.40,EN,,0,0,0,,This is where the coaching element
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.54,0:06:10.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,这就是执教的部分
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.40,0:06:11.36,EN,,0,0,0,,is not teaching.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.40,0:06:11.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,不是教技术
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.36,0:06:12.44,EN,,0,0,0,,There's teaching and coaching.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.36,0:06:12.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,教技术和执教是两回事
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.44,0:06:13.76,EN,,0,0,0,,Coaching is about strategy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.44,0:06:13.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,执教讲的是战术
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.76,0:06:16.56,EN,,0,0,0,,It's about game plans and trying
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.76,0:06:16.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,是比赛计划 是尽量
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.56,0:06:18.50,EN,,0,0,0,,to help with the individual match -ups
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.56,0:06:18.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,帮每一场对位出主意
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.50,0:06:20.06,EN,,0,0,0,,because you only have to be better
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.50,0:06:20.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,因为你只需要比
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.06,0:06:21.70,EN,,0,0,0,,than one player.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.06,0:06:21.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,一个对手更好
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.70,0:06:24.48,EN,,0,0,0,,It was very close today, but Casper was able
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.70,0:06:24.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,今天很接近 但卡斯珀能够
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.48,0:06:25.70,EN,,0,0,0,,to be better than Cerundolo
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.48,0:06:25.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,比塞伦多洛更好
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.70,0:06:29.10,EN,,0,0,0,,and that's why we got the point.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.70,0:06:29.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以我们拿到了这一分
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.10,0:06:31.70,EN,,0,0,0,,Okay, thanks very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.10,0:06:31.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,好 非常感谢
